<PageTitle>DungeonTable</PageTitle>

<h1>DungeonTable</h1>

<p>A two-view app for running D&amp;D dungeons at the table.</p>

<ul>
    <li><a href="dm">DM view</a> &mdash; the control surface with the room briefing panel.</li>
    <li><a href="player">Player view</a> &mdash; fullscreen projector view (revealed areas only).</li>
    <li><a href="editor">Room editor</a> &mdash; draw regions, tag doors/stairs, and place feature markers over the vector map.</li>
</ul>
